// spec_review 活动 v2（合同对抗）：QA 立场评审 ⇄ 开发逐条采纳/驳回并改规格，代码判分，不限轮数按走势收敛。
import { describe, it, expect, beforeAll, beforeEach, afterEach } from 'vitest';
import crypto from 'node:crypto';
import fs from 'node:fs';
